      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Rang Undang-Undang Jualan Dadah (Pindaan) 1999"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Jualan Dadah (Pindaan) 1999."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini hendaklah mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta. Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Jualan Dadah 1952 [Akta 368], yang disebut \"Akta ibu\" dalam Akta ini, dipinda dalam seksyen 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan \"(1)\" yang terdapat sebelum perkataan \"In this Act\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan takrif \"drug\" dengan takrif yang berikut: * \"drug\" includes any substance, product or article intended to be used or capable, or purported or claimed to be capable, of being used on humans or any animal, whether internally or externally, for a medicinal purpose;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif \"inspector\" takrif yang berikut: ' \"medicinal purpose\" means any of the following purposes:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_g"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "alleviating, treating, curing or preventing a disease or a pathological condition or symptoms of a disease;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "diagnosing a disease or ascertaining the existence, degree or extent of a physiological or pathological condition;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "contraception;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "inducing anaesthesia;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "maintaining, modifying, preventing, restoring, or interfering with, the normal operation of a physiological function;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "controlling body weight;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "general maintenance or promotion of health or well-being;'; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_3",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_3__para_d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_2__list_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam takrif ' \"sale\" or \"sell\" ', dengan memotong perkataan \", and refers only to sale for human consumption or use\". Pindaan seksyen 9"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 9(4) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"effect of this Act shall be liable\" dengan perkataan \"effect the provisions of this Act commits an offence and shall be liable on conviction\". Pindaan seksyen 10"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 10 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong subseksyen"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "(4). Jualan Dadah (Pindaan) Penggantian seksyen 12"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 12 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \"General 12. (1) Subject to subsection (2), any person who penalty, commits an offence against this Act or any regulation made under this Act for which no penalty is expressly provided shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding twenty-five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both, and for a second or subsequent offence he shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both. (2) Any body corporate who commits an offence against this Act or any regulation made under this Act for which no penalty is expressly provided shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit, and for a second or subsequent offence it shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit.\". Pindaan seksyen 17"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 17 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"human\" di mana-mana jua terdapat perkataan \"or animal\". Pindaan seksyen 23"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 23(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"the fact\" perkataan \"that\". Pindaan seksyen 26"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/20/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 26(1)(k) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"the fine, not exceeding one thousand ringgit,\" dengan perkataan \"a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or both\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
